OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate CEO's
OL,4,Aaffair with suspected Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS tech giant Nvidia opens an
OL,7,Findependent investigation into claims
OL,8,Fits CEO Jensen Huang had an affair with
OL,9,Fa Chinese spy
OL,11,FHuang admits to being unfaithful to his
OL,12,Fwife: "There is no excuse for what I
OL,13,Fdid"
OL,15,FNvidia - one of the most valuable firms
OL,16,Fin the world - says the investigation
OL,17,Fwill look at reports that Huang was
OL,18,F"the target of a foreign intelligence
OL,19,Feffort"
