OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate CEO's
OL,4,Aaffair with suspected Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm says it has no reason to
OL,7,Fbelieve Nvidia's secrets or national
OL,8,Fsecurity were compromised, but it will
OL,9,F"examine all available information"
OL,11,FThe New York Times first reported last
OL,12,Fmonth that Jensen Huang had a close
OL,13,Frelationship with Alice Huang, a boss
OL,14,Fat a Singapore-based data centre
OL,15,Fcompany - and that she was suspected of
OL,16,Fgiving information to China
OL,18,FJensen Huang - who moved from Taiwan to
OL,19,Fthe US as a child - says he is
OL,20,Fcommitted to "America's national
OL,21,Fsecurity"
